<title>USA: NYS Dormitory Auth. $773 mln taxable revs priced.</title>
<headline>NYS Dormitory Auth. $773 mln taxable revs priced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Thursday that it priced $773 million of New York State Dormitory Authority federally taxable pension obligation bonds, 1996 issue, with a top yield of 6.90 percent in 2003.  </p>
<p>DORMITORY AUTHORITY OF THE STATE OF NEW YORK</p>
<p>RE: $773,475,000*</p>
<p>FEDERALLY TAXABLE PENSION OBLIGATION BONDS</p>
<p>1996 ISSUE</p>
<p>We have set the coupons on the above issue.</p>
<p>We have received the verbal award.</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Baa1		  S&amp;P: BBB		   FITCH: A</p>
<p>DATED: 10/15/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 10/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 04/01 &amp; 10/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
